<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- ===== Pipeline foundation (always run) ===== -->

  <!-- EN: base cost from tech level -->
  <UWU_BaseCostFromTechLevel.label>技術レベルによる基本コスト</UWU_BaseCostFromTechLevel.label>
  <!-- EN: Provides a fallback base cost derived from the weapon's tech level. Ensures all weapons have a customization cost even if they lack a craftable recipe. Neolithic uses wood, medieval uses steel, industrial uses steel and components, and spacer and above use plasteel and advanced components -->
  <UWU_BaseCostFromTechLevel.description>武器の技術レベルに基づくフォールバックの基本コストを設定します.製作レシピを持たない武器にも必ずカスタマイズコストが設定されるようにします.新石器時代は木材,中世はスチール,産業革命はスチールとコンポーネント,宇宙世紀以上はプラスチールと先進コンポーネントを使用します.</UWU_BaseCostFromTechLevel.description>

  <!-- EN: base cost from recipe -->
  <UWU_BaseCostFromRecipe.label>レシピによる基本コスト</UWU_BaseCostFromRecipe.label>
  <!-- EN: Replaces the tech-level fallback with the weapon's actual crafting recipe costs, including both fixed ingredients and stuff costs. Only acts when the weapon has a craftable base definition. -->
  <UWU_BaseCostFromRecipe.description>技術レベルによるフォールバックを,固定材料と素材コストの両方を含む武器の実際の製作レシピコストに置き換えます.武器に製作可能な基本定義がある場合にのみ作用します.</UWU_BaseCostFromRecipe.description>

  <!-- EN: quality multiplier -->
  <UWU_QualityMultiplier.label>品質倍率</UWU_QualityMultiplier.label>
  <!-- EN: Scales costs based on weapon quality. Higher-quality weapons cost more to customize. Includes the base 50% cost fraction so each trait costs half the weapon's full recipe value before quality scaling. -->
  <UWU_QualityMultiplier.description>武器の品質に応じてコストを増減します.高品質な武器ほどカスタマイズのコストが高くなります.基本の50%コスト係数を含んでおり,品質による増減の前は各特性のコストが武器のレシピ総額の半分になります.</UWU_QualityMultiplier.description>

  <!-- EN: negative trait material downgrade -->
  <UWU_NegativeDowngrade.label>ネガティブな特性の素材ダウングレード</UWU_NegativeDowngrade.label>
  <!-- EN: Downgrades cost materials by one technology level for negative traits. Spacer components become industrial, plasteel becomes steel, steel becomes wood. Reflects that negative modifications use cruder, cheaper techniques. -->
  <UWU_NegativeDowngrade.description>ネガティブな特性のコスト素材を技術レベル1段階分ダウングレードします.先進コンポーネントはコンポーネントに,プラスチールはスチールに,スチールは木材になります.ネガティブな改造には粗雑で安価な技術が使われることを反映しています.</UWU_NegativeDowngrade.description>

  <!-- ===== Thematic rules (keyword-matched) ===== -->

  <!-- labelKeywords, whole-list injections: every English keyword is kept
       verbatim (those are what match the language-invariant defName tokens) and
       confirmed Japanese trait labels are appended. A Japanese label carries no
       ASCII space or hyphen, so it is a single token and a keyword can only
       match a trait whose ENTIRE label equals it; every token below is an exact
       label shipped by Unique Melee Weapons or vanilla Odyssey.
       Deliberately omitted: グリップ and 象眼 (bare roots that match nothing -
       CustomGrip's label is 改造グリップ and the inlays are 金の象眼 /
       ヒスイの象眼), ゼウス / モノソード / プラズマソード (weapon-name roots, no
       trait uses them alone), 快適さ (extrapolated from the Comfort StatDef, no
       confirmed trait wording), フレア for UWU_Flarestriker (a bare loanword
       that also reads as solar or lens flare - too generic to ship), and 重弾
       for UWU_Oversized (vanilla's OversizedRounds is ammo framing, not an
       oversized weapon). カウンターウェイト and 針先 ARE shipped despite being
       generic outside the melee-trait domain, per the scouting judgment that a
       misapplied stuff swap is low-stakes. UWU_HeavyScrap gets no injection at
       all: it sets requireAllKeywords, so appending anything would demand all
       entries at once and break the English heavy+scrap pair, and Japanese
       could never supply two space-delimited tokens anyway. -->

  <!-- EN: toxic component swap -->
  <UWU_ToxSwap.label>毒性コンポーネント置換</UWU_ToxSwap.label>
  <!-- EN: Replaces components with herbal medicine (3x the component count), reflecting the organic toxins needed. Weapons whose costs carry no components instead add herbal medicine scaled to the weapon's crafting complexity. -->
  <UWU_ToxSwap.description>必要となる有機毒素を反映して,コンポーネントを薬草(コンポーネント数の3倍)に置き換えます.コストにコンポーネントを含まない武器では,代わりに武器の製作の複雑さに応じた量の薬草を追加します.</UWU_ToxSwap.description>
  <!-- EN: tox, toxic, paralytic, acid-injector, venom, envenomed, poisoned, opiated, sedative -->
  <UWU_ToxSwap.labelKeywords>
    <li>tox</li>
    <li>toxic</li>
